  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please consider removing the type-trees requirement as part of the server-side verification for worlds. For worlds without scripting, they aren't required for Unity to load them and attempts to make tiny worlds are foiled by this.\n\nExample of a tiny world without type-trees (700 bytes): https://vrchat.com/home/world/wld_00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\n\nExample of a world that _can_ be ~700 byes but is forced to have them, making it 3.35kb: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_86fcf743-d2a5-4fc5-aae4-4fb6da2c221f",
